[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4333057200","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117569#issuecomment-4333057200","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117569","id":4333057200,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAkU0sA","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T07:03:22Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T07:03:22Z","body":"Got a weird thing with @Nodragem starter kit. When setting it up like in your video and selecting the GridMapBuilding, it works as I expect. But selecting the training area it gets confused.\r\n\r\nThe training area is a subscene so that could be related, but editing the subscene, it only sometimes works.\r\n\r\nI wonder if switching between scenes, or if multiple gridmaps are in play, that doesn't choose the right viewport settings?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4333057200/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4335548784","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117569#issuecomment-4335548784","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117569","id":4335548784,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAms5cA","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-28T13:12:00Z","updated_at":"2026-04-28T13:12:00Z","body":"So I tested that scene, and the reason is because that node is rotated 90 degrees, which makes the grid rotate with it.\r\n\r\nNow, I think the only way to handle this would be to throw a warning telling the user to not rotate their `GridMap`s? Because trying to somehow make the grid always parallel with the viewport would break the moment a non-quarter circle rotation is used.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4335548784/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4351137929","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117569#issuecomment-4351137929","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117569","id":4351137929,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA1kYiQ","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-30T09:06:01Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T09:06:01Z","body":"> Now, I think the only way to handle this would be to throw a warning telling the user to not rotate their GridMaps? Because trying to somehow make the grid always parallel with the viewport would break the moment a non-quarter circle rotation is used.\r\n\r\nWe should not discourage people from rotating their gridmap scenes. As part of level design, you often want to break the feeling that everything is aligned with the grid. For instance, you may build a few houses with the gridmap, and then instantiates multiple houses with different rotations to build a city that does not feel it is done on a grid.\r\n\r\nMy suggestion is that the \"Allow Viewport Override\" feature should only work when the Gridmap is the root of the scene. Hence, in my above example, you can use it when you edit the house itself, but it won't work on houses when you are placing houses in your city.\r\n\r\nThis echoes back to a previous conversation we had during the initial video call with both @BastiaanOlij and @YeldhamDev  : we should probably not allow the users to edit Gridmaps that are imported as scene into a scene; except if editable children is enabled.\r\n\r\nWhat are your thoughts?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4351137929/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4353120385","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117569#issuecomment-4353120385","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117569","id":4353120385,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA3dYgQ","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-30T14:04:48Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T14:04:48Z","body":"@Nodragem\r\n> My suggestion is that the \"Allow Viewport Override\" feature should only work when the Gridmap is the root of the scene. Hence, in my above example, you can use it when you edit the house itself, but it won't work on houses when you are placing houses in your city.\r\n\r\nAnd how does that fixes the issue? Rotating the root node still makes so that the grids aren't aligned anymore.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4353120385/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4353937423","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117569#issuecomment-4353937423","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117569","id":4353937423,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA4PQDw","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-30T15:46:01Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T15:46:01Z","body":"I forgot that we don't have a warning when we rotate the root anymore (see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104331). \r\n\r\nStill,  we could support the \"Allow Viewport Override\" feature only when a Gridmap node is the root node, and it has no rotation. If the user happens to rotate a root Gridmap, we would give a warning that it disables the \"Allow Viewport Override\" feature.\r\n\r\nAlso, should we try to find a more descriptive name? I am thinking maybe \"Snap Floor to Orthogonal View\" or \"Sync Floor with View\", but it is never simple to have good names!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4353937423/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4358011240","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117569#issuecomment-4358011240","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117569","id":4358011240,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA8H5aA","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-01T05:38:56Z","updated_at":"2026-05-01T05:38:56Z","body":"Oef, that's an unforeseen consequence. Good we caught it.\r\n\r\nI think we probably can improve this somewhat to allow exact 90 degree rotations, just read out the correct row (/column? always mix that up) from the rotation matrix.\r\n\r\nThen if it turns out the grid is not rotated to something axis aligned, disable the viewport override function.\r\n\r\nIf we have the viewport override enabled, we could use `_get_configuration_warning` to show that this gridmap doesn't support viewport override because it's rotated.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4358011240/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4382448052","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117569#issuecomment-4382448052","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117569","id":4382448052,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBTbZtA","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T19:44:35Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T19:44:35Z","body":"The PR has been updated to make the grid face the viewport as best as it can.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4382448052/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4810223962","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117569#issuecomment-4810223962","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117569","id":4810223962,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHrYxWg","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-26T13:55:32Z","updated_at":"2026-06-26T13:55:32Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4810223962/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]